      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FRIZZA (7) made a nice return at his latest appearance a week-and-a-half ago, finishing 5.5 metres away in second over 1730m at Bathurst. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and will be looking for a split at some stage. Finds a nice race and will take plenty of beating once more. SLICK BY DESIGN (8) settled handy before taking the lead and finding plenty only to finish a very close second last start over 1700m at Cowra, adding to his good win at Bathurst the run before. May need luck at some stage extracting from the inside of the second row. Finds a suitable assignment and can find the winners' enclosure. CAPTURE OUR HEART NZ (4) didn't do a bad job when fifth over 2270m at Riverina Paceway last time out. Each-way claims. INTERESTINME (3) must be considered after he finished runner-up over 1730m at Bathurst two-and-a-half weeks ago.",
